Announcement that due to the Presidents Day holiday on Monday, February 20, 2023, regularly scheduled City Council Committee meetings will instead be held as follows: Finance Committee will meet at Noon on Tuesday, February 21, 2023 and Public Services Committee will meet at Noon on Wednesday, February 22, 2023.  Both meetings will be held at 2101 O’Neil Avenue, Room 104 and via electronic conference meeting.
